    <briefdescription>
<para>ECDSA HSM IP driver implementation for the Low Power F3 family. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>============================================================================</para><para>This file should only be included in the board file to fill the ECDSA_config struct.</para><para><heading level="1">Hardware and Implementation Details</heading>
</para><para>The driver is backed by a software ECC library implementation.</para><para><heading level="1">Supported Curves</heading>
</para><para>The driver implementation supports the following curves for ECDSA:</para><para><table rows="8" cols="1"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Curves Supported  </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>NISTP256 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>NISTP224 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>NISTP2384 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>NISTP521 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>BRP256 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>BRP384 </para></entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>BRP512 </para></entry></row>
</table>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
